  "scope": "# Review \u2014 09636f05e06e / training:319f2597\n\nAssignment `review-dfd2ef16162b976a`; canonical generator v2.0.0, SHA `0477dc50fdff9ac43529ebbddd8173ac0641eaf0311929f51d51439040493e69`.\nChange: added an executable, task-local 27-setting parameter prototype, focused tests and concise current notes.\nLabels: matching Racket for every pair; demo-only candidate fitting and four distinct queries in each saved example.\nChecks: 54 existing tests + 21 prototype tests pass; independent review found no actionable defect.\nFinal all-settings probe: 189 pair occurrences on seven shared inputs, 108 query checks, plus 108 boundary labels.\nFixed during authoring: fresh-zero rival incorrectly collapsed iteration into global erasure; retained red regression now passes.\nLimits: finite candidate family, restricted authoring distribution and bounded requests; no model-learning or all-seed proof.\nReference changes: none; original generator, canonical ledger, base solution and approval records retain packet bytes.\nDisposition: main prototype ready for maintainer review; two bounded supplementary tickets blocked before fresh Racket results.\n",
